#!/usr/bin/env python3
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
BED BOUNCE — Python (pygame) version of the Bed Bounce web game.
Updated edition: same features as the live web version —
full-body sleeper + fallers, head bonus (+2), splat animation,
rocket + meteors, theme music, Firebase leaderboard with prizes,
king/BOSS badges and the weekly giveaway countdown.

Web version : https://xdotdex.github.io/Fuckgames/
GitHub      : https://github.com/XDOTDEX

Run:
    pip install pygame
    python bed_bounce.py

Controls:
    Mouse drag / arrow keys   move the bed
    SPACE                      pause / resume
    ENTER                      start / play again
    M                          theme music on/off (game sounds always on)
    Drop an image file onto the window (or put myface.png next to
    this script) to use your own photo as the falling face.
"""

